   "text": "cartography/ — boundaries, keyed\nnatural_earth  admin 0/1 · public domain\noverture       admin 0–3 · DuckDB on S3 · ODbL\ncensus         US states/counties · FIPS\ngisco          NUTS 1–3 · © EuroGeographics\n\nrecognised_borders(): Crimea = Ukraine\n(UN GA 68/262); Western Sahara split\nOverture release from STAC `latest`",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "re025",
   "originalText": "cartography/ — boundaries, keyed\nnatural_earth  admin 0/1 · public domain\noverture       admin 0–3 · DuckDB on S3 · ODbL\ncensus         US states/counties · FIPS\ngisco          NUTS 1–3 · © EuroGeographics\n\nrecognised_borders(): Crimea = Ukraine\n(UN GA 68/262); Western Sahara split\nOverture release from STAC `latest`",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
