   "text": "⚠ biggest limitation (to discuss)\nOutside data = a hand-written 10-entry catalogue or a URL the model already knows.\nNo internet search -> most held-out failures are data discovery.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "re033",
   "originalText": "⚠ biggest limitation (to discuss)\nOutside data = a hand-written 10-entry catalogue or a URL the model already knows.\nNo internet search -> most held-out failures are data discovery.",
